<title>POLAND: SWARZEDZ FEB NET RISES TO PLN 0.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>SWARZEDZ FEB NET RISES TO PLN 0.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results February</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.17 vs   0.02</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.26 vs   0.11</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.57 vs   1.05</p>
<p> Sales		   11.23 vs   7.67</p>
<p>JANUARY-FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.30 vs   0.09</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.56 vs   0.18</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.73 vs   2.18</p>
<p> Sales		   21.10 vs  16.74</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish furniture maker is Swarzedzkie</p>
<p>Fabryki Mebli SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
